{
  "_about": "Sample data for BookCast: books about artificial intelligence. Every person, work and edition carries an explicit id so references stay unambiguous when names or titles repeat. A work has an originalTitle (the title in the language it was written in) and an optional commonTitle (the best-known English title, only when it differs). An edition title is the title as printed on that edition. contents is ordered by position. Covers are not stored: the app builds the cover URL from the ISBN (Open Library Covers API). photoUrl is filled in by hand.",
